{"title":"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Bailey scores on six of her eight shots. The percentage of shots that she does not score on is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/6/84602838df5004435fc0e469ff6eef107207e46f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 40 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 20 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solving for the percentage of shots that she scored on, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/d/ebd8a189fb61b14afad5ddc8bce40c66bdb558f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{8} = 0.75 = 75\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The percentage of shots that she scored on added to the percentage of shots that she didn't score should result in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bd818354ff89f378b1c6b3d4df72f3c8c508b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />. Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the percentage of shots that she didn't score, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae7d096b1b1e821074e8d42e2f2d4c12cc5a3dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + 75\\% = 100\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b892e6aa3d6e53ce32d61cc8966b3e33db91517a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/b/61b85ce74ddaa70ca15fb6e800397531281fb5bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of shots that she missed. Since she scored on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> shots out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> shots, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/e/a4e5b7bc83a4a9aec93d3f75ee913bd2b9a39a24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m + 6 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/865dd25261a2f76b4036ca6b566e0d94c0ffd612.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Solving for the percentage of shots that she missed based on the calculated value of m, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea61399b34bdbbcdc54710f5d75bd9bc6f1dc5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{8} = \\frac{2}{8} = 0.25 = 25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"173\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/b/61b85ce74ddaa70ca15fb6e800397531281fb5bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Ga